@startuml regional-query
title US-12: Historical Regional Query - Time Chunk Pruning + H3 Index Filtering

skinparam sequenceArrowThickness 1.5
skinparam participantBorderColor #555555
skinparam participantBackgroundColor #F8F8F8
skinparam noteBorderColor #AAAAAA
skinparam noteBackgroundColor #FFFDE7

participant "Express API" as API
participant "H3 Library" as H3
database "TimescaleDB\nposition_history" as TSDB

API -> H3 : convert requested geographic region\nto HISTORY_H3_RESOLUTION cells
H3 --> API : matching/covering H3 cell IDs

API -> TSDB : SELECT ... FROM position_history\nWHERE geo_cell IN ($cell_ids)\nAND observed_at BETWEEN $t1 AND $t2

note over TSDB
  TimescaleDB partitions by observed_at only.
  Time predicates enable chunk exclusion.
  geo_cell index narrows rows inside selected chunks.
  H3 does not create separate TimescaleDB chunks.
end note

TSDB --> API : matching historical position rows

@enduml
